According to a report by IntelMarketResearch, the global Surface Mount Gas Discharge Tubes Market was valued at USD 215 million in 2025 and is projected to reach USD 306 million by 2034, expanding at a CAGR of 5.6% during 2025–2034. Surface mount gas discharge tubes are compact over-voltage and lightning-protection components designed to protect sensitive electronic circuits. Their low capacitance, high surge-handling capability, and compact surface-mount form factor make them increasingly relevant to telecom infrastructure, automotive electronics, industrial systems, and high-speed data applications.
