Regional Outlook
Asia-Pacific was the largest market in 2025, contributing roughly 45% of global sales. Strong electronics manufacturing clusters, telecom infrastructure investment, and EV charging deployment support regional demand.
North America and Europe are supported by stringent EMC and safety requirements, advanced telecom infrastructure, EV adoption, and industrial automation.
Emerging markets are also expected to create opportunities as smart infrastructure, renewable-energy systems, and connected electronics expand.
